SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The mmkkddiirr() system call is expected to conform to ISO/IEC 9945-1:1990
     (“POSIX.1”).  The mmkkddiirraatt() system call follows The Open Group Extended
     API Set 2 specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The mmkkddiirraatt() system call appeared in FreeBSD 8.0.  The mmkkddiirr() system
     call appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.

